This project's card scanner (frontend/src/features/scanner/) was designed
after studying the approach taken by the two open-source projects below.
No source files from either project were copied, translated line-by-line,
or vendored; every file listed here is an independent TypeScript
implementation written against this app's own stack (React + Vite +
Tesseract.js + GraphQL). Both projects are credited regardless, as a
courtesy and for traceability.

